mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, the bridge role + connections\n\ncontent-audit is the **retrospective bridge** — it reads how an existing account has performed and turns\nit into a keep/kill/refresh roadmap that feeds the forward plan. It **reads** (via\n`analytics-and-reporting`) and **recommends**; the human and the other skills **act.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **Retrospective, not strategy.** This triages the **past**; `social-strategy` plans the **future** (the\n  audit informs it). Don't conflate.\n- **Reads WoopSocial post analytics** for TikTok, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, YouTube, and Bluesky, and native dashboards otherwise, via\n  `analytics-and-reporting`. The agent **interprets** and\n  **never fabricates** a metric or a coverage analysis.\n- **Score on signal, not vanity** (saves/shares/replies + the goal-mapped KPI). **Low likes is not a\n  kill criterion.**\n- **Recommend, don't auto-act.** **Never auto-delete** — a human approves kills (deleting can lose\n  evergreen/SEO value + history); **refresh before kill.** Some profile edits are **in-app/human**.\n- **Thin data → structural audit only.** With too few posts, do the qualitative/structural pass (profile,\n  pillars, voice, cadence) and set a baseline; revisit performance triage at ~90 days.\n- **Output an action plan**, not a spreadsheet graveyard — owners + timelines.\n\n## The bridge role (reads ← → feeds)\n**Reads:** `analytics-and-reporting` (performance), `brand-profile`/`voice-builder` (the voice standard),\n`content-pillars` + `social-strategy` (the intended plan), `goals-and-kpis` (the targets).\n**Feeds:** `content-recycling` (scale/refresh winners), `content-pillars` (rebalance whitespace),\n`profile-optimization` (fixes), `voice-builder` (drift/evolution), `social-strategy` (the revised plan),\n`experimentation-and-ab-testing` (re-test uncertain calls).\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **content-audit (this)** — **periodic retrospective triage of YOUR account** (keep/kill/refresh +\n  pillars/voice/profile).\n- **analytics-and-reporting** — **ongoing measurement** + reporting (the data source this consumes).\n- **competitor-analysis** — **rivals'** public side (this is your own account).\n- **social-strategy** — the **forward plan** the audit informs.\n- **content-recycling** — **scales/refreshes** the winners the audit surfaces.\n- **profile-optimization** — **executes** the profile fixes the audit flags.\n\n## Where this connects\nReads first: `brand-profile`, `content-pillars`, `social-strategy`, `analytics-and-reporting`. Findings\nhand off to: `content-recycling`, `content-pillars`, `profile-optimization`, `voice-builder`,\n`social-strategy`, `experimentation-and-ab-testing`. Benchmark context: `competitor-analysis`, `goals-and-kpis`. Covers\nall active platforms (the per-platform `*-growth` skills inform format/native expectations). No\npublishing/tool surface — a diagnostic + planning skill.\n"
